        { "text": "$x=7$ or $x=5$", "why": "Solved $2x-7=0$ as $x=7$, ignoring the coefficient of $x$." },
        { "text": "$x=\\frac{2}{7}$ or $x=5$", "why": "Inverted the fraction from $2x-7=0$, writing $x=\\frac{2}{7}$ instead of $\\frac{7}{2}$." }
