      "solution_text": "$2x^{2}-17x+35=0$\n$2x^{2}-7x-10x+35=0$\n$x(2x-7)-5(2x-7)=0$\n$(2x-7)(x-5)=0$\n$x=\\frac{7}{2}$ or $x=5$"
